window.products.push({"id":230106,"name":"Victorinox-Swiss-Army-Cutlery Fibrox Pro Curved Slicing Knife, 10.25-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D3LbIuExL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"A TRUSTED FAVORITE Preferred by both home chefs and culinary professionals, the 10.25\" Victorinox Fibrox Pro Curved Slicing Knife can handle nearly every butcher task imaginable. Crafted with a comfortable handle, superior weight and balance, and a razor sharp blade that rarely requires re-sharpening, this knife is an essential tool for every kitchen. KEY FEATURES High-quality, lightweight European steel. High-quality, lightweight European steel. Handle design reduces hand and wrist fatigue. Handle design reduces hand and wrist fatigue. Fit for slicing both firm and soft meats. Fit for slicing both firm and soft meats. Long, curved blade for maximized cutting performance. Long, curved blade for maximized cutting performance. Non-slip, textured handle for a secure and comfortable grip no matter the hand size. Non-slip, textured handle for a secure and comfortable grip no matter the hand size. National Sanitary Foundation (NSF) approved and dishwasher safe. National Sanitary Foundation (NSF) approved and dishwasher safe. CARE AND USE Be good to your knives and they’ll be good to you. Following these simple guidelines will ensure that you get the longest life out of your knife! CLEANING Victorinox Swiss Army recommends washing all knives by hand. For best results, hand wash your knives with a soapy cloth and dry immediately.  While Fibrox Pro knives are dishwasher safe, we recommend hand washing as dishwashers are designed to spray water at a relatively high pressure, which can jostle the silverware and cause the knives to collide, dulling the edge. SHARPENING For optimum performance, knives should be honed after every couple of uses. Proper and frequent use of a honing steel will keep your knives sharper and performing at their best. FORMERLY FORSCHNER In 1937 Victorinox began selling cutlery in America through a Connecticut distributor called R.H. Forschner & Co. A well-known manufacturer of butcher scales, Forschner soon became the exclusive U.S. distributor for Victorinox knives, and was the name by which Victorinox knives were known.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D3LbIuExL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victorinox","source_asin":"B07NW9S1YK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NW9S1YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NW9S1YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230107,"name":"BODUM Grande Veneziano Thermal 11.2-Ounce Jumbo Cup with Stainless Saucer, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wdn5jvTYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Drinking freshly brewed tea or coffee is a ceremony, especially if you serve your beverages in the distinguished GRANDE VENEZIANO double wall glass cups (0.03 l, 10-ounce) with stainless steel saucers. No matter what beverage you serve, be it tea or coffee, hot or cold, the manifold colors of the liquid will be reflected by the shiny surface of the stainless steel saucers, producing a whirlwind of luminous reflections on every tea or coffee table. The double wall cups are made of mouth-blown, heat-resistant, ultra-light borosilicate glass. Due to the special double wall glass thermal effect, the cups remain cool on the outside while keeping your drinks hot for a longer period of time. In addition, the VENEZIANO cups are comfortable to hold due to their light-weight and streamlined ergonomic shape. The VENEZIANO cups are microwave and dishwasher friendly and due to the high quality borosilicate glass, they will not get cloudy over time. The saucers are also dishwasher safe, but should not be placed in the microwave. Other VENEZIANO sizes available are PICCOLO VENEZIANO small cup (0.07 l, 2.4-ounce) and MEZZO VENEZIANO medium cup (0.15 l, 5-ounce). Sold in a set of two.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wdn5jvTYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B001E9MB4Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001E9MB4Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001E9MB4Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
