window.products.push({"id":230214,"name":"FiveSeasonStuff Real Touch Calla Lily Artificial Flowers Wedding Bridal Bouquet | Floral Arrangements | 15 Calla Lilies (Festive Burgundy)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t0c33PzWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As spring flowers, summer flowers, autumn flowers or winter flowers, calla lilies are great all year round. The bright and dark hues are great for different party and celebration themes or table centerpieces for dining room Most importantly, each color has its own meaning and symbolism. Calla lilies are most often associated for purification, hopes, rebirth, resurrection For example, calla lilies used in a marriage or wedding symbolize receiving marital devotion and bliss Try mixing a few colors for unique DIY floral arrangements or bouquets Notes: calla lily color may vary due to differences in monitor displays If placing outside as decoration or using as a flower for a grave or in cemetery, exposure to the sun and external elements like rain, snow and temperature will likely, in long-term affect the color to fade overtime which is a normal process like for most artificial plants or fake plants","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t0c33PzWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FiveSeasonStuff","source_asin":"B08CDN11NV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CDN11NV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CDN11NV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230215,"name":"HOMCOM 6' Tall Unlit Pencil Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with Realistic Branches and Steel Base, Pink and White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XdlOAY8KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Seriously No-Hassle: If you're looking for a UNLIT artificial Xmas tree that holds its shape and is a securer option for your family, look no further than this 6/7 ft Christmas tree in gradient of white and light pink with extremely slim pencil shape, allowing you to decorate small living area or a second Christmas tree in an entryway. No more crowded farms (yech), no more allergies (phew), no fires, no watering, no needles, you get the idea. Make Fluffing Fun: The only time you're really spending is fluffing the tree that has an auto open design, which can be a family-friendly way to decorate and share some hot chocolate, or make it a game: race against the clock, compete to see who fluffs the most, create an obstacle course…the options are nearly endless. More Ambience Is Better: A flame-retardant realistic pine tree decor is going to give some extra peace-of-mind in case you have to put your tree next to your fireplace. Of course, it's great ambience on its own, but a fireplace...I mean, come on. Easy, Easy, Easy: Here's where the rubber meets the road: you get a slim cardboard box (easy storage). You get three pieces to put together (easy assembly). You get a lightweight and strong base. Even though it's a fake Christmas tree, we've got you covered start to finish. Pink Christmas Tree Information: In order to get a full appearance, please spread out all individual tips to get the best possible look from the tree.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XdlOAY8KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMCOM","source_asin":"B0B8JBN4RF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8JBN4RF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8JBN4RF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230216,"name":"Tektite Natural Glass Rock Polished 0.75-1.25 Inch w Info Card","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VHjz1bZTL._AC_.jpg","description":"This Novel Mineral Specimen Comes With A Fact-Filled Information Card...Tektites are most prevalent near impact craters of meteorites. There are more than 150 known meteorite craters worldwide, with more being discovered each year. The meteorites that caused these craters weighed from 100 to thousands of tons, and impacted the Earth at an estimated speed of 47,000 miles per house. The resulting explosions, equivalent to many nuclear bombs, ejected molten matter into outer space at suprersonic speeds. As they cooled, these molten rocks (mostly glassy quartz) became aerodynamically shaped into teardrops, flattened spears and dumbbells with pits and striations. Gravity then pulled them back to Earth. Tektites are made of Earth material, but were actually formed in space! Picture is representative of the specimen you will receive. Each rock is unique and will vary in shape, size and appearance. No two rocks will be exactly alike.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VHjz1bZTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Squire Boone Village","source_asin":"B0045EQIVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0045EQIVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0045EQIVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230217,"name":"Lfwellness Memory Foam Travel Neck Support Pillow for Airplanes - Patented Structure Compact Neck Pillow Easy Storage for Travel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+8M-9TzJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Cloud Nine neck pillow is designed to offer you reliable support when you need a rest from your busy life. It has a streamlined, curved shape that is compact and stylish. It seamlessly and gently contours to your neck, cheek and lower jaw when you are sitting or sleeping in an upright position. High resilience memory foam holds its shape so that your neck stays supported.This pillow makes it easy to rest on the go. When not being used, roll it and pack it down to the size of a soda can to store it in its storage bag. You can bring it with you anywhere easily. Bring your pillow on plane or car trips, or even to work!The machine washable pillow cover is made of Football Jersey Grade Fabric which is comfortable, breathable and cold-proof. The zipper allows for easy removal and cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+8M-9TzJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lfwellness","source_asin":"B075YY3X4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075YY3X4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075YY3X4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
