window.products.push({"id":230297,"name":"King Size Mattress Protector Waterproof Mattress Cover Washable Soft Cotton Terry Matressprotector King Breathable Noiseless Vinyl-Free Deep Pocket 76","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FyqwMK1hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ 100% Impervious to Liquids of All Kinds: Protect your mattress from everyday accidents. Our waterproof mattress protector are laminated with a super-thin TPU membrane that is impervious to all liquids. Dual-layered protection shields your mattress from sweat, urine, beverages and other fluids, while also preventing liquids from pooling. Great for kids, pets, incontinence care, etc. ❤ Ultra-Soft & Noiseless: Top layer is made of 80% cotton terry that is so soft you’ll forget it’s even there. Super-thin TPU backing isn’t “plasticky” like other mattress protectors and won’t make noise when you toss and turn. It is 100% impervious to liquids while still allowing air to pass through, keeping you cool, dry and comfortable throughout the night. ❤ Easy to Clean & Durable: Machine washable. Repeated washing will not cause deformation or deterioration of the premium, elastic material or damage the specially designed waterproof membrane. Tip: Purchase more than one to protect your mattress while laundering. ❤ Ultimate Mattress Protection: Our Premium mattress protector are free of phthalates, Vinyl, BPA, formaldehyde, lead, heavy metals and other harsh chemicals. TPU Membrane barrier also protects you from any hazards lurking in your mattress, thereby promoting a healthy sleeping environment. ❤ Warranty & Risk-free Service: Purchase our products with confidence. If you are not satisfied for any reason, simply contact our Customer Support team. We will do our best to make sure you are 100% satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FyqwMK1hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panda Grip","source_asin":"B08M9V17HV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M9V17HV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M9V17HV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230298,"name":"WDong Stretch Sofa Covers Printed Couch Cover Loveseat Slipcovers for 2 Cushion Couch Sofa Universal Couch Cover 2 Seater with 1 Pillowcase(Medium, Go","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nRb7OSN4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring WDong elastic & printed sofa cover home.  Give your sofa cover a modern brand new look. High-Quality Fabric 95% polyester 5% spandex fabric makes our sofa cover more elastic and durable.Chemical-free,highly safe for children and pets. Elastic and soft fabric The fabric is not only highly elastic, but also soft that feels comfortable. Wrinkle-free Material Wrinkle-free material makes your sofa look perfect with soft and smooth touch. One free cushion cover included (no inner) Package includes one sofa cover and one matching cushion cover Universal suitable to over 99% home sofa size between: - Small - 1 seat : Chair length between 35\" - 51\" (90 -130 cm)  - Medium - 2 seat : Loveseat length between 53\" - 67\" (135 -170 cm)  - Large - 3 seat : Sofa length between 69\" - 86\" (175 - 220 cm)  - X-Large - 4 seat : Big Sofa length between 88\" - 114\" (225 - 290 cm) Tips before order The printed sofa cover is not waterproof.  Please measure your sofa before order.Better Choose LARGER one if you are not sure.  The attached foam strips can be used flexibly for installation, if not enough, cloth strips can be used instead.  Colors showed in screen may different from the actual items. 【How to install:】 Steps 1: Position the slipcover over the sofa with the label at the back.  Steps 2: Pull the fabric evenly over the sofa, and push white sponge cylinders in spaces between the cushions, shaping the cover to the sofa and keeping fabric tight.  Steps 3: Tilt the sofa up and find elastic ties. Pull the front and back ties together tightly and tie. Pull the side ties together and tightly.  Steps 4: Put the sofa down and pull the cover tight along with excess fabric to the back.  Steps 5: Enjoy your newly covered sofa!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nRb7OSN4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WDong","source_asin":"B0BHVQ4JH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230298","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHVQ4JH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHVQ4JH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
