window.products.push({"id":230365,"name":"ZENDORI POSTER \"Live Laugh Love\" Poster Print on Canvas Paper (No Frame) - French Country Decor - Made In USA - 12\" x 18\" Christmas Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S1pojRapL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ZEN ART is a unique art form expressing the artist's spiritual awareness. It would be a great addition to your home, giving your family members some teachings and spiritual inspiration. Most zen paintings appear simple, direct, inspirational and meaningful. \"Live, Laugh, Love\" is a poster print art with the following features: ★ Made in USA  ★ Measures 12 x 18 inches  ★ Paper Weight: 130 lb. cover  ★ Design is printed on a canvas paper using UV digital printing technology  ★ UV finished - making the piece glossy  ★ Inspiring message of hope, love and renewal designed by Zendori  ★ Print DOES NOT come with a frame. Frame it or put between glasses to display.  ★ Shipped in a thick and strong white envelope Message displayed says: “Live, Laugh, Love\", perfectly summing up what life should be. This poster reminds us to (1) Live - because life is too short (2) Laugh - because it is the best medicine and it is contagious and (3) Love - because it is the sweetest thing that can happen to you! This decorative wall decor is a great way to keep positive and a beautiful reminder of what is essential in life. The inspirational office decor's uplifting messages will surely leave you feeling good each time you look at it. It is shipped in a thick and strong white envelope for extra added protection. This is an ORIGINAL and AUTHENTIC piece made in the USA. Grab this beautiful poster for you or send it as a gift! Add to cart while stock lasts!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S1pojRapL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zendori","source_asin":"B07G5ZS738","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G5ZS738","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G5ZS738","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
