window.products.push({"id":230387,"name":"NOVICA Set of 2 Embroidered Applique White and Black Floral Cushion Covers 'Jaipur Blossom'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oXnuS3OaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Anil Khandelwal in India presents an elegant pair of cushion covers, handcrafted from ecru cotton. The covers are lavishly embroidered in black, silver-grey, white and yellow for a striking accent to any decor. Both covers feature plain ecru backs and zipper closures for easy cushion insertion. - Features a zipper closure - Cushion(s) not included - Hand wash only About our Artist: 'I'm Anil from Rajasthan, India. I studied up to 10th grade and went to Alwar for further studies. After finishing high school I moved to Jaipur to study commerce and law. After finishing studies, I got a job in Rajasthan roadways and during that time I was introduced to Babulal who was in the handcrafts sector and looking for a trustworthy person to help him. My friend Ganpat introduced me to him and I started working with him. I learned a lot including embroidery work and block printing. Soon, I realized this is my calling and left my job. '","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oXnuS3OaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01MCWBADQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MCWBADQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MCWBADQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
