window.products.push({"id":230445,"name":"Elemental Kitchen Airtight Glass Capsule Food Storage Container Set w/Measuring Cup Lids - 3 Piece Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EPg7c2F6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Practical, perfect sizes, and thoughtfully designed Elemental Kitchen Glass Food Containers are designed to adapt to your food storage space. Though the heights of each container differ, the consistent width of each container makes them align-able and easy to organize. Our borosilicate glass food storage containers are attractive enough to display on your counters, but strong enough to last you for years to come. And thanks to our airtight lids, your food will stay fresh longer and retain its nutrients. Our airtight canisters work equally well for liquids such as juice, soup, stews and sauces and because of the airtight seal; you don’t need to worry about spills. About Elemental Kitchen Good design is elemental... For over 15 years Elemental Kitchen has specialized in kitchen products, with more. We start with a common kitchen product. Then we make it better with stainless steel, silicone and plastic. Combining these materials drives our innovations. But, we don’t just make products. We design them. We research people’s lives at home so we can create products that are smart, simple, and stylish. We start with a fresh look at real-world food preparation, storage, measuring, serving, convenience and organization. Then we develop ways to enhance your efficiency and make life more enjoyable at the same time. Because Elemental Kitchen combines design innovations with state-of-the-art manufacturing, rigorous testing and a thorough quality control system, we will bring only the finest housewares to your home. Quality and Convenience Made of high-quality, borosilicate glass, our airtight food storage containers have been tested to be durable and long-lasting. Their design will save you a ton of space in your pantry and cabinets for better kitchen organization. They’re pretty enough to set on your countertops, and keeps your frequently used food items close at hand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EPg7c2F6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elemental Kitchen","source_asin":"B0748262LY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0748262LY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0748262LY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
