window.products.push({"id":230466,"name":"NEATERIZE Storage Bins With Lids (Set of 4) - Heavy-Duty Empty Fabric Storage Organizers with Removable Lids & Dual Handles. Great For Photos, Toy box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AYRjHkLXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ PRODUCTS DETAILS: 33 Quart. - SIZE: 16(L) x 12(W) x 10(H) Inch (41x31x 26CM) - MATERIALS: Heavy-Duty MDF wood covered by breathable fabric stackable storage bins. ★ LONG-LASTING QUALITY! Once put to use, these handy storage boxes are there for the long haul! Constructed from heavy-duty MDF wood covered by ultra-sturdy, breathable fabric, superior stitching. Our storage boxes with lids are here to serve you in good stead. Also features 2 handles that are sewn through the MDF to prevent ripping off. Super easy to re-use and clean, you’ve finally got the simplest storage bins to every clutter crisis! ★ MAKES A GREAT TOY BIN: Looking for a great toy storage box for boys or girls? These storage bins teach kids the importance of organization and cleaning up after themselves. Six different color containers for organizing to choose from, you can find a color that fits your space for girls or boys. Use these large storage bins with lids for plush toys, dolls, cars, playsets, books and stuffed animals, all while keeping rooms neat and clean. ★ FULL HOME MAKEOVER! Overstuffed Closets? Doors that barely close? Constantly losing and misplacing items? Endure that frustration no longer! Organize every corner of your home, from toys, bedroom, playroom baby nursery, under the bed storage , garage to the laundry room and bathroom, with these versatile stackable storage containers with lids. Enjoy the peace of mind only tidiness brings! ★ YES, YOU CAN DIY! Easiest assembly! Unfold the basket and insert the bottom creating a rigid floor. To undo, remove the bottom piece and it folds flat, compact and storage friendly! RISK FREE PURCHASE! ABSOLUTELY LOVE IT OR GET A FULL REFUND BACK- NO QUESTIONS ASKED!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AYRjHkLXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEATERIZE","source_asin":"B09T7W4M48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T7W4M48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T7W4M48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
