window.products.push({"id":230557,"name":"HE601 Replacement Filter Compatible with Shark Air Purifier 6-Fan Models(HE601&HE602), 3-in-1 H13 True HEPA Filter for Shark HE601/HE602, Compared to ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71An83jNNOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Fully Compatible with Shark Air Purifier HE601/HE602】This premium HE601/HE602 Hepa replacement filter is specifically designed to fit Shark air purifier 6-fan Models (HE601, HE602). Compared to #HE6FKPET. 【3-in-1 True HEPA Filtration System】Our HE601/HE602 air filter is made of 3-in-1 H13 True HEPA high filtration efficiency material, which effectively captures at least 99.98% of airborne particles as small as 0.3 microns in the air. This system provides a new comfortable air environment for you and your family. 【High-Efficient Filtration & Long Service Life】Cabiclean HE601/HE602 air filter replacement for Shark Air Purifier 6 Fan Models HE601/HE602 is made of eco-friendly non-woven fabric and activated carbon, to ensure high-efficiency filtration and longer service life. 【Cost-Effective Package】Package includes 1 pack high-efficiency HE601/HE602 replacement filter, which help save money for you. The HE601 replacement filter should be replaced every 6-12 months depending on the air quality in your area and the use of the Air Purifier to ensure optimal performance. 【Buy with Confidence】 Cabiclean has been committed to providing all customers with high-quality and cost-effective air purifier filters, and help customers build a better living environment. We provide 90-days warranty or refund for each customer, we value each customer, and our after-sales team will provide each customer with satisfactory service. 【Product Size】15.1\"L x 1.6\"W x 24.8\"Th NOTE: After installing the new filter, please press and hold the Filter Life button on the top control panel for 3 seconds to reset the timer. The unit will beep when the timer is activated.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71An83jNNOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cabiclean","source_asin":"B0BMPJB1GF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMPJB1GF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMPJB1GF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230558,"name":"skyDrama 20X24 Black Frames - Made to Display 16x20 Pictures with Mat or 20X24 Without Mat, Wall Mounting Portrait and Landscape Art -Polystyrene Glas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OCbizFZfL._AC_SL1145_.jpg","description":"20 x24 Inch Black Picture Frame includes an White color mat for 16x20\" photos. The Black Picture Frame with Polystyrene Glass come with easy-opening turn Tabs & hassle-free horizontal & vertical Format Hangers for hanging flat against the Wall. HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS – this Photo Frame provides elegantly crafted, clean-lined Borders; POLYSTYRENE GLASS allows for high clarity, improved scratch-resistance & is splinter-proof; Strong, easy to use Hanging Hardware & thick & stylish ivory Color Photo frame Mats are already built in. SIZE & DISPLAY - classic horizontal & vertical Formats Picture Frame has finished Size of 20x24x1.5 INCHES. This Photo Frame is perfect for 16” x 20” Pictures with Mat or 20” x 24” photos without Mat. This black Picture Frame includes built-in, ready-to-use Hangers on the back for both vertical and horizontal hanging Options, making it easy & hassle-free for you to showcase your Photos or Art beautifully. EXCLUSIVELY DEVELOPED PACKAGING – for safe Delivery of fragile glass Items like this Picture Frame, Packing of our Photo Frame includes special Foam Corner Protectors plus front & back Padding. To protect the Surface from scratches, the Picture Frame itself is also shrink-wrapped. UNIVERSAL USE AND PERFECT GIFT – In Gallery, at Home or Work - this Picture Frame with Polystyrene Glass is one of the Photo Frames for Walls Decorations that blends perfectly with any Space. The Classic Picture Frame is perfect to set up the Gallery Wall with the most precious Photos or Arts. An Accent in any Room, this White Photo frame pairs well with family Photos or eclectic Prints and is great for gifting at Baby or housewarming Parties & at any Family Events.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OCbizFZfL._AC_SL1145_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"skyDrama","source_asin":"B0BX4TLT7H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX4TLT7H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX4TLT7H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
