window.products.push({"id":230661,"name":"Ellis Curtain Bristol Collection Two-Tone Plaid Bradford Valance Window Curtain, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y+LxuIOaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bristol two-tone plaid Bradford valance window curtain-plaid continues to reign as one of fashion's favorite trends. The Bristol plaid collections precise pattern and amazing hue of colors create a soft appearance and eye-catching visual that will blend with your home decor. The soft seven-ounce 100-percent cotton duck fabric creates a softer texture and smoother draping effect that sometimes can't be achieved with inferior synthetic fabrics. The Bradford valance is a lined two layered, double scalloped valance. The top layer is a two-tone plaid pattern and is accented by a solid color bottom layer with bias binding to add a clean crisp edge. It is made with a 3-inch rod pocket and decorative 2-inch header. Measuring 70-inch wide and length is measured overall 15-inch from header top (ruffle above the rod pocket) to bottom of panel. For wider windows simply add multiple valances together. Bradford valance can be combined with coordinating Bristol plaid tailored tier curtains and tailored pair drape panels with tiebacks that are available thru Amazon. Also available are 2-piece lined swag curtains, valances, toss pillows and shower curtains. Made in the USA, dry clean only","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y+LxuIOaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ellis Curtain","source_asin":"B004V3IR3E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004V3IR3E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004V3IR3E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
