window.products.push({"id":230816,"name":"Amélie Home Boho Throw Blanket, Bohemian Farmhouse Colorful Striped Blanket with Tassels Decorative Woven Textured, Soft Cozy and Lightweight for Spri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S9uW3v6+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE DESIGN - Meet our new favorite boho throw blanket. Full of handmade details, this knit throw blanket will add a bohemian style and a perfect farmhouse look to your home. Woven geometric details and fabulous tassels are inspired by the French countryside lifestyle to decorate and your place in a natural and tasteful way. HIGH QUALITY - Woven from high-quality knit, this decorative boho throw blanketdoes not shrink and wrinkle after washing. It's lightweight and durable as well as easy to maintain. Tufted details and fringe are well-made and won't unravel in the wash. MULTY PURPOSE - Amélie Home textured throw blanket is handy any time of the year. It will keep you warm in the fall and winter seasons and freshen up your home with a pop of color and style during spring and summer. Keep one on your sofa, couch, or at the end of your bed for cozy nights by the fireside, or take outdoors for chilly summer evenings on the farmhouse porch or for a picnic at the park. IDEAL GIFT - Lovely packaged with a bow ribbon, surprise your loved one, a friend, or a colleague with this amazing gift. Not only this knit throw blanket is very stylish and comfortable, but also super easy to maintain, which makes it a perfect present for a Mother's day or other occasion. EASY CARE - Not only it looks and feels amazing, it's also very durable and easy to maintain. We recommend washing in cold water on a gentle cycle. Tumble dry on your lowest dryer setting with low heat (do not iron).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S9uW3v6+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amélie Home","source_asin":"B0983KG1R3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0983KG1R3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0983KG1R3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230817,"name":"Feather & Stitch 6 Piece Sets of Bathroom Towels, 100% Cotton Highly Absorbent Luxury Super Soft Shower Towel for Daily Use | Spa | Hotel 2 Bath Towel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OSEVknkkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"6 PIECE BATH TOWEL SET: It contains set of 6 bathroom towels includes 2 Bath Towels (27\"X 54\"), 2 Hand Towels (16\"X 28\"), 2 Washcloths (13\"X 13\"). 100% Combed Staple Cotton bath towel set. Lightweight towels quickly absorbs moisture. HIGHLY ABSORBENT: Feather & Stitch towels are woven from 100% Cotton two-ply yarns and are 625 GSM. They are highly aborbent and super soft. Low twist construction woven with 100% premium long staple combed cotton. The higher GSM of these towels will not go unnoticed as you step out of the shower into the plush, contemporary waffled texture.These luxe towels are available in a variety of beautiful colors to refine any home or hotel bathroom. DOUBLE STITCHED HEMMED FINISH: Each towel is finished with a double stitched hems at the border to give them a clean edge while preventing it from unraveling. It also adds to the elegance of the towel set. Great gift idea for men and women, moms and dads, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas, New year OEKO-TEX CERTIFIED TOWELS: Made in 100% certified OEKO-TEX Standard factory, an independent certification system that ensures textiles meet high safety and environmental standards meaning everything from the dyes and fabrics to accessories are tested and verified as free from harmful levels of more than 300 substances. We are committed to giving you what suits you the best: fresh, breathable, and naturally soft 100%cotton towel sets EASY CARE: Machine washable & dryable, Wash in cold water, Tumble dry low. Wash separately before first use. Do not use bleach at any stage of washing and drying. Use warm water to wash towels in order to avoid color bleeding. Do not use fabric softeners as they decrease the life and fluffiness of your towel by breaking down the fabric","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OSEVknkkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FEATHER & STITCH NEW YORK","source_asin":"B09SB5SD1R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SB5SD1R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SB5SD1R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
