window.products.push({"id":230836,"name":"The Display Guys - Black Wooden Square Profile Picture Frame With Mat - Wall Mounting - Tabletop Display - 11\" x 14\" - Value 2-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NhYNjSSFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PLEXIGLASS – Each picture frame from The Display Guys comes equipped with plexiglass glazing. Ensuring that you can protect cherished artworks and photographs with quality plexiglass that doesn’t shatter. MUSEUM QUALITY MAT – Museum-quality mat in creamy white. All mats are acid free to prevent damage to art displayed, and to extend lifespan of the piece. Mats have a beveled edge for a more professional look. Mat features a mat opening about ½” smaller than the photo. EX: Mat is for 11” x 14” pictures, mat opening would be 10.5” x 13.5”.  Perfect for a gallery-style display. MINIMALIST DESIGN – Keep it simple. Clean lines and a modern finish make frames from The Display Guys a perfect fit for any setting. Frames feature a textured wood-grain surface that blends perfectly with both traditional and modern décor. SIZING – The Display Guys picture frames boast 0.5” thickness and a 0.75” border width. This value pack contains 2 frames to be used in your home, office, dorm room, apartment. Update your space with contemporary design. PRE-ASSEMBLED – Each frame comes equipped with a picture-frame wall mount. Pre-attached hardware fits for both vertical and horizontal wall hangings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NhYNjSSFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TheDisplayGuys For Your Modern Living","source_asin":"B08N3WPXJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N3WPXJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N3WPXJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
