window.products.push({"id":230845,"name":"LAZYKITTY 4x6 Double Picture Frame Vertical - Reinforced MDF, Real Glass Faces, Stainless Steel Hinged, Multi-angle Foldable, Standing on Tabletops - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZOiQ8GO6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-quality and Eco-friendly Material Frame made of reinforced MDF (quite dense, sturdy, durable, and eco-freindly), REMOVABLE real glass faces (highly transparent, easy to clean, wear-resistant, and scratch-resistant), two 18/8 stainless steel hinges (smoothly rotatable by 0-180°). Easy to Use and Clean, Stable on the Table 8 flexible metal tabs fixed on the photo frame, easily opened and closed. Raise all tabs, the back panel and glass can be easily removed (the glass can be wiped with a damp cloth or rinsed directly with water). Thick enough (0.6 inches), stable on the desktop without any support. Ideal Gift Idea & Perfect for Memorializing Classic, stylish, and attractive, terrific for gifting (as Christmas gift, birthday gift or memorial plaque), Suitable for the photos of the special event we wanted to memorialize, fits for any room (living room, office, entertainment center, etc.). Unique Design Two 4x6 picture frames with REAL glass faces (fits for two 4\" x 6\" photos side by side), portrait orientated, joined together by 2 hinges, folded and parked at any angle (0-180°)(just like opening a book), well-textured surface with perfectly finished corners, PROUDLY designed in USA. Protective Packaging Strict quality control before shipment, double-layer independent packaging design (eco-friendly vacuum protection film and extra thick packaging box), all for safe delivery and customer satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZOiQ8GO6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAZYKITTY","source_asin":"B0BHKWLZHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHKWLZHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHKWLZHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
