window.products.push({"id":230849,"name":"Set of 4 Wheat Straw Plates - Reusable Unbreakable Wheatstraw Plastic Dishes Dinner Plates - Deep Plates with Lip Edge, Microwave & Dishwasher Safe Mi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W4dJntCpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 4 Wheat Straw Plates -- Create the perfect tabletop presentation with our wheat straw plastic plates reusable dishes. These eye-catching microwavable plates look just as beautiful stacked inside the kitchen cabinet as they do laid out in an elegant table setting. Lightweight, with raised edges to keep food from falling off when scooping. An Upscale Look for Everyday Meals -- You'll love these wheat straw/plastic dinner plates for parties, family gatherings, holiday dinners, BBQs, outdoor picnics, and as your 'daily drivers' for casual everyday meals and snacks. Upscale, attractive and stylishly designed, these microwave safe plates provide a creative backdrop for your culinary masterpieces (or blunders). Unbreakable, Shatterproof, Kid Friendly -- The nearly unbreakable plates are 100% shatterproof, splinter-free, and drop-proof. Durable and resistant to chipping, scratches, and wear-related damage. Perfect as camping plates or reusable plastic plates for RVs, Airbnb’s, the lake house, beach house, or break room at work. Putting People and Planet First -- Dishwasher safe! Replace your disposable paper plates with an easy to clean, nature-based alternative that looks great and holds up even better. At Green Dish we help you make more environmentally guided choices so you can reduce your consumption of plastic, while encouraging greater reliance on eco-friendly solutions and natural materials. Environmental Charity & Lifetime Warranty -- By partnering with One Tree Planted, a non-profit organization focused on global reforestation, we make it simple to help save the environment. That's why every order you place with us equals a new tree planted in your name. Together we can restore forests, create habitats for biodiversity, and make a positive social impact around the world. Your purchase isn't just green, it's guaranteed: all Green Dish products come with a Lifetime Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W4dJntCpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GREENDISH","source_asin":"B0BKK2S51S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKK2S51S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKK2S51S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230850,"name":"iDesign Forma Lupe Stainless Steel Metal Sink Dish Drainer Plastic Tray Kitchen Drying Rack For Glasses, Silverware, Bowls, Plates, 13.3\" x 17.5\" x 5.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BVZhOFijL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make the most of your kitchen space with the iDesign's Forma Lupe Sink Dish Drainer! This quality stainless steel dish rack can be placed anywhere on the counter, not just by the sink. The metal rack removes easily from the amber plastic tray for hassle-free draining and cleaning. The removable rack holds 15 dishes and sits neatly in the closed-bottom tray. The cutlery tray holds all your silverware, spatulas, and wooden spoons separately. Made with durable plastic and rust-resistant stainless steel with a bronze finish, this drying rack has a 100% waterproof bottom tray for your convenience. Measuring 13.3\" x 17.5\" x 5.2\", the iDesign Forma Lupe Sink Dish Drainer is the answer to your organizational needs! With iDesign by InterDesign, you can #LiveSimply every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BVZhOFijL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iDesign","source_asin":"B07VQPRCJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230850","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VQPRCJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VQPRCJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230851,"name":"FACILCASA Chair Caning Supplies - Easy KIT - 36\"X18\" Cane Webbing Mesh, 13' of #8 Spline, 4 Wood Wedges, Caning Chisel - 5/16\" Wide,Tool to Cut, Sandp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cbwK4jUyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural high quality product! Cane is the generic term for the hard outer bark of the Rattan palm. Cane webbing mesh is pre-woven cane web made by machine from strands of chair cane and sold in cane webbing sheets. When the seat webbing has a groove around the edge, the seat is made of pre-woven “machine-made” cane web. A rattan spline is pressed and glued into the groove to hold the open cane webbing in place. Cane fabric may seem fragile but it can actually bear very heavy loads. Chair cane webbing is primarily used for re-seating stylish cane chairs, such as the classic Thonet chairs or the Marcel Breuer cesca chair. Complete kit This is a wicker furniture repair kit for repairing the cane chair seat, suitable for caned chairs with wicker fixing system like the Viennese chair. In the chair recaning kit you will find everything you need to do the job: ✔ Natural cane web, of the highest quality ✔ chair caning spline with a diameter of 4,5 mm ✔  4 wooden wedges ✔ ✔ Screwdriver ✔ tool to cut ✔ Clear, detailed instruction manual with pictures and text in 5 languages (Italian, English, French, German and Spanish) Measures: ★ Kit for 2 seats: 36\"X18\"(90x46cm) press cane + 13ft ø 5/32&quot; (4m ø4mm) cane wicker ★ Kit for 4 seats: 71\"X18\"(180x46cm) press cane + 26ft ø 5/32&quot; (8m ø4mm) cane wicker ★ Kit for 6 seats: 106\"X18\"(270x46cm) press cane + 39ft ø 5/32&quot; (12m ø4mm) cane wicker Check your chair's dimensions: the seat must not exceed 16 1/2'quot; (42cm) on the side. Give a new life to your chairs, buy EASY KIT cane chair repair kit now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cbwK4jUyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FACILCASA","source_asin":"B07FRMCHS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FRMCHS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FRMCHS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
