window.products.push({"id":230885,"name":"CAROTE Non Stick Pots and Pans Set, 4 Pcs Frying Pans & Saucepan Set, Kitchen Cookware Sets, PFOS & PFOA Free, 8\" & 10\" Frying Pan,1.5 QT Saucepan wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615qMAcbSjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4-Piece Cookware Set: The pots and pans set includes 8\" Frying pan + 10\" Frying pan + 1.5 QT Saute Pan with Lid Eco-friendly Granite Material: Nonstick granite material, SGS & EUROFIN approved, with 100% free of PFOS, PFOA, lead and cadmium. The 5-ply thickened nonstick interior stands up to everyday use and chip-resistant. Great Nonstick Performance: Excellent non stick performance keeps food sliding smoothly along the surface for easy clean. Less oil needed & less smoke released, our pots and pans set provides your daily cooking always safer and healthier. Heat Up Quickly and Evenly: The induction pans set adopts large magnetized base and provides a larger heating area, which allow to distribute heat quickly and evenly resulting in no hot spots. Suitable for gas, electric, ceramic, glass, halogen and induction hobs. Service & Guarantee: CAROTE has over 25 years experiences in non-stick cookware, in case you receive defect or damaged cookware set by shipping, please feel free to contact us, we will address your concern within 24 hours and all cookware is guaranteed to get 100% refund or new replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615qMAcbSjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAROTE","source_asin":"B0BK8J4T4J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK8J4T4J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK8J4T4J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230886,"name":"SCB- 9 Pak (Medium 1 3/4 inch) Pennsylvania Heavy Duty Suction Cup Hooks for Glass Windows. Signs Holiday Ornaments Suncatchers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a2qYypVmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our suction cups are made of highly flexible PVC plastic or neoprene. These materials are preferred to natural rubber because they are stronger and more resistant to sunlight, abrasion, and temperature extremes. These handy devices are designed to conform to the shape of the surface that they are stuck to and will adhere best to surfaces that are smooth and non-porous, like metal or glass. The care and use of suction cups is very simple. 1.Make sure the suction cup is clean and free from debris. 2.If the suction cup needs to be cleaned, wash in warm soapy water then dry gently with a lint-free cloth. 3.Clean the surface you are applying the suction cup to. It won’t adhere well to a dirty surface. 4.To enhance suction, a tiny dab of Vaseline or cooking oil may be rubbed on the rim of the cup. 5.Press the cup all the way down, against the surface. 6.The suction cup may need to be “burped” periodically by pressing down on it to remove any air that may have seeped in. 7.Temperature and humidity variations may make a suction cup lose its grip. If bonded above 40⁰ F/5⁰ C the cup will provide the most reliable service from -22⁰ to 120⁰ F.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a2qYypVmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Suction Cup Buddy","source_asin":"B095X8MBBJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095X8MBBJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095X8MBBJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
