window.products.push({"id":230952,"name":"Milburga Premium Antique Pewter Stag Whiskey Decanter Set with 2 Glasses – Luxury Non-Leaded Crystal Liquor Decanter Set - Stylish Decanters and Exqui","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ALyb2AGBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTIFULLY HANDCRAFTED SHOWCASE – Indulge yourself in our breath-taking handcrafted bourbon decanter set for serious whiskey aficionados and impress everyone with your distinct taste. With crystal clear glass and handcrafted antique looking pewter details, this attractive whiskey decanter and glass set allows you to show off the most recent addition to your collection of aged liquor. THE CROWN JEWEL OF YOUR HOME BAR – With unique design, our vintage crystal decanter set adds a touch of luxurious 007-style elegance to your home bar. Beautifully appointed with fearless pewter stag, not only does it look good in your house, it comes in a luxurious gift box. So whether it’s birthday, Father’s Day, housewarming, wedding or anniversaries, you can surprise every whiskey enthusiast with this meaningful gift. PRESERVES WHISKEY AND ROOM TO SPARE – This unique liquor decanter set with air-tight stopper is bound to be a conversation starter, whether it’s a formal affair, or just a gathering of friends. At 12.5 oz each, the two bourbon tumblers have plenty of room for whiskey stones, balls or ice cubes. If you’re a true enthusiast, you’ll know what that’s all about. SAFE FOR EVERYDAY USE – Made from 100% lead-free crystal and pewter, our scotch decanter set is ideal for storing and serving your favorite liquor in any party or occasion, no matter how often you have something to celebrate. The liquor decanter also has a thick heavy-weighted base so you know that it’s durable and won’t break. 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEED – All of our products come with 100% satisfaction guarantee. In the improbable case that you are not 100% thrilled with our whiskey decanter gift set, we will either replace the product or offer you a full refund, with no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ALyb2AGBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MILBURGA","source_asin":"B07QGMRTQR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QGMRTQR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QGMRTQR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
