window.products.push({"id":230971,"name":"LunchBoss QUME WHITE EDITION PRO - 17oz-TOUCHSCREEN TEMPERATURE DISPLAY | TRIPLE Vacuum Insulated BOTTLE | HIGHEST-GRADE SAMURAI Stainless Steel Inter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MlA8siLDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How many times have you bought a beverage bottle and stopped using it after a week because it ended up making your life harder? Don’t you wish there was a bottle that was both practical and stylish? Thanks to the QUME LED Temperature Display Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Thermos Pro with Tea/Fruit Strainer, you don’t have to wish any longer. The QUME is both water and leak proof and it fits in most vehicle cup holders, so you don’t have to worry about it rolling around your car’s floor. It has a wide mouth that makes it easy to drink from and clean. You can even create fruit infused water using the strainer! You also don’t have to worry about burning your lips anymore, because the QUME comes with a temperature display on the top of the bottle. You’ll know instantly how hot or cold your beverage is thanks to the Celsius reader. You know how hard it is to take water bottles to work. They end up falling and breaking within a few days. That concern is now a thing of the past, because the QUME was built with durability in mind. It’s fashioned out of a single piece of high-grade 18/8 stainless steel that won’t rust or break if you drop it. We say “if” you drop it because unlike other water bottles, this one comes with a condensation and burn-free exterior. You don’t have to worry about your bottle slipping out of your hand again. Features: - Keeps beverages Cold for up to 24 hours and hot for up to 13 hours Includes detachable filter for tea, ice, fruit, or coarse ground coffee Condensation and burn-free exterior Made from stainless steel Displays the temperature in Celsius of your bottle’s contents Display battery lasts over 1,000 hours Stop buying a new beverage container every few weeks. The QUME is the only container you’ll need again. ORDER YOURS TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MlA8siLDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LunchBoss","source_asin":"B07XG5CW7J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XG5CW7J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XG5CW7J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230972,"name":"Picture Sensations® Framed 4-Panel Canvas Art Print, Pittsburgh Bridge City Skyline - 48\"x32\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516v+IarYOL._AC_.jpg","description":"Picture Sensations - as our name implies, we want you to feel various sensations when you experience and enjoy our careful selections of digital prints on canvas. Whatever your inspiration is for buying our artwork, we hope to make your place a little more \"you\". all of our framed canvas prints are made to a very high standard. The art is printed at high-resolution on superb quality artist cotton canvas. Giclee prints utilize the latest and most sophisticated ink-jet printing technology which provides better accuracy than other means of transferring images on the canvas. We use the finest basswood stretcher frames to frame our art. The image wraps around the sides resulting in a superb finished product which will look great on your wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516v+IarYOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Picture Sensations","source_asin":"B01HP33UGU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HP33UGU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HP33UGU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230973,"name":"Vera Nice Hotel Collection Ultra Soft Pillow Case (4-Pack) – All-Natural Pure Aloe Vera Treatment – Eco-Friendly, Hypoallergenic Pillow Cover Infused ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iRLMomKYL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"The Vera Nice Pillowcase Set, made from aloe vera infused double-brushed brushed microfiber, was designed with comfort, durability and style in mind. These luxurious pillowcases stay wrinkle free with no ironing required and are a perfect addition to any bed set! These unique pillow cases are infused with 100% all-natural aloe vera, a plant known for it's moisturizing and skin-soothing properties. The aloe vera treatment ensures these pillow cases will remain smooth and soft after each wash, and the natural health benefits help to rejuvenate and moisturize your skin, so you'll wake up feeling relaxed and revitalized. Our pillowcases are machine washable for easy cleaning, and can be simply tumble dried - no ironing or expensive dry cleaning required!Don’t wait - order your Vera Nice Aloe Vera Infused Pillowcases today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iRLMomKYL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vera Nice","source_asin":"B077H56F9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077H56F9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077H56F9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230974,"name":"PASSENGER PIGEON Bamboo Cordless Window Blinds, Gently Filters Light into Room Roll Up Blinds Shades with Valance, 72\" W x 96\" L, Dark Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L6YIVN+pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MOUNT TYPES: Inside mounted shades will have a deduction taken of approximately 0.4\" to ensure a proper fit inside the window frame.Inside mounted shades require a minimum frame depth of 3.5inch for secure installation. If your window frame depth is less than 2.5inch please select outside mount.Outside mounted shades should be ordered with the exact width of the area you wish to cover. Outside mounts are often used when there is not sufficient frame depth for inside mounting.Our shades come with all mounting hardware, and mounting hardware for both inside mount and outside mount INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the inside frame width at three locations-the top,middle,and bottom. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number deduct 1/4inch as your inside width when ordering. Step 2. Measure the height at 3 locations-the left,middle,and right side. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use the number as your inside width when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 6-10inch to be the outside mount width. Step 2. Measure the outside frame length adding 5-10inch to be the outside mount length. The overlap it recommended to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps. Type: Bamboo Roller Shades Feature: Light Filtering Material: Polyester Fabric Installation: All Mounting Hardware Included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L6YIVN+pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PASSENGER PIGEON","source_asin":"B07S41KCSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S41KCSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S41KCSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":230975,"name":"Cute Tools Ice Cream Scoop - Chef Tested For Daily Use, Durable Stainless Steel Tool, Classic Hand Painted Wooden Handle Scooper, Smooth Scooping Of Y","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RPFa+Ke9L._AC_SL1170_.jpg","description":"It's hard to believe that serving ice cream could be even MORE fun, but with this adorable scoop, it is! A sturdy wooden handle topped off with a deep, steel scoop makes for easy dipping and serving. And you can make those really hard cartons even easier to tackle by warming the scoop in a cup of hot water beforehand. Art For A Cause produces a unique line of beautiful, quality, hand painted tools for the home, kitchen and garden called CuteTools! Each top-quality steel product is hand painted in one of several proprietary designs to become fun and functional pieces of art. The company has engaged the community by employing individuals with special needs such as cerebral palsy, muscular dystrophy, multiple scleroses and other cognitive challenges. The tools are sanded, primed, decoratively painted, and packaged. In addition to the social responsibility the company embraces, CuteTools arrive in attractive, unique sustainable packaging which encourages recycling and environmentalresponsibility. Each tool comes in a corrugated cardboard box which slides into a PVC outer sleeve to allow clear visibility of the product. Tucked inside is a package of basil seeds, filled and packed by the special needs students. The seed packets encourage consumers to utilize the cardboard as the medium for growing the seeds. Instructions for creating a \"mini-greenhouse\" are printed on each packet along with the company's mission statement, \"A company which strives to promote an improved work ethic for the preservation of our planet and its people. Plant a seed. Make a difference.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RPFa+Ke9L._AC_SL1170_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CuteTools!","source_asin":"B007KE0T78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-230975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007KE0T78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007KE0T78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
